    "### Loss Functions\n",
    "\n",
    "| Loss | Formula | Role |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| **Chamfer Distance** | Σ min‖p_i − q_j‖² (bidirectional) | Main shape accuracy |\n",
    "| **Edge Length** | mean(edge lengths) | Prevents degenerate triangles |\n",
    "| **Laplacian** | ‖L·V‖² | Prevents self-intersections / keeps surface smooth |\n",
    "\n",
    "We apply these at **every stage**, with coarse stages getting less weight (0.2 / 0.3 / 0.5). This is the coarse-to-fine curriculum."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "8179fbf7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
